# Weight profile flashnext-unc-3.05: Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Uncensored (orcarouter's abliterated build of
# Qwen/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next) in Lygodactylus's EXL3 3.05 bpw pack (the HF repo below at the pinned commit,
# ~72.4 GB with its n-gram table), its own MTP draft layer, the table cold. The table is read past the
# page cache.
# The pack loads as published: its vision tower is EXL3 in the shards, in the form the loader builds
# (engine/models/flashnext/vision.py), so no tower sidecar is needed (unlike flashnext-unc-4.05, whose
# tower shipped unquantized). No QSE_FN_VISION_FILE: the pack has no vision_k6.safetensors (its
# tower is in the shards).
# Switch with ops/use-profile.sh flashnext-unc-3.05.
QSE_FN_BPW=unc-3.05
QSE_WEIGHTS_REVISION=fe57295cac48562c0de8dc5cbf4d7b26c0ebd26d
QSE_WEIGHTS_GB=72.4
QSE_FN_TABLE=cold
# MemAvailable (GiB) a start needs: the built-in flashnext-3.05 profile's numbers, unchanged (this
# pack's weights measured 47.87 GiB on the device at load, the built-in pack's 47.87;
# vision 0.29 GiB).
QSE_MEM_NEED_GIB=70
# SRV-335: the engine's limits, the built-in flashnext-3.05 profile's.
MEM_CEILING_GIB=66
MEM_PEAK_GIB=77
. "${REPO}/ops/profiles/_flashnext.env"
# the one line _flashnext.env hardcodes to turboderp's repo: this pack is Lygodactylus's
QSE_WEIGHTS_HF=Lygodactylus/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-Uncensored-exl3-3bpw
